          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n   1. The applicant must be residing in Gujarat.\n   1. The applicant must be a Scheduled Caste individual.\n   1. The applicant must be an adult (18 years or above).\n   1. The applicant must have completed a 6-day poultry farming training.\n\n&gt; **Note:** Females and beneficiaries Below Poverty Line (BPL) will be given priority.\n\n"
